msgid "1. Service description"
msgstr "1. Descripción del servicio"

msgid ""
"TradeFlow Colón (“TradeFlow”, “the Platform”) is a B2B and B2C intermediary "
"marketplace focused on the Colón Free Zone (CFZ), Republic of Panama. "
"TradeFlow facilitates contact, quoting, and order management between buyers "
"and registered seller companies;"
msgstr ""
"TradeFlow Colón («TradeFlow», «la Plataforma») es un marketplace "
"intermediario B2B y B2C orientado a la Zona Libre de Colón (ZLC), República "
"de Panamá. TradeFlow facilita el contacto, la cotización y la gestión de "
"pedidos entre compradores y empresas vendedoras registradas;"

msgid "it does not act as the direct seller"
msgstr "no actúa como vendedor directo"

msgid ""
"of listed products or as a carrier, unless an additional contracted service "
"is expressly indicated."
msgstr ""
"de los productos publicados ni como transportista, salvo que se indique "
